### Restore realized items through the active view

**Severity:** `high`

`RegisterExistingRealizedItems` only searches `ItemsList`, even though this control can render an `ItemsGrid`. A grid page therefore loses visible-item demand after the view loads and initializes its visible rows in speculative order. Use the active view for both the panel and container lookup so restored rows retain their priority in either layout.

```suggestion
            if (ItemView.ItemsPanelRoot is { } panel)
            {
                foreach (var child in panel.Children)
                {
                    if (child is SelectorItem container && ItemView.ItemFromContainer(container) is ListItemViewModel item)
                    {
                        RegisterRealizedItem(container, item);
                    }
                }
            }
```
